All active film and series production is driven through `tools/cinematic_studio_cli.py produce-film`:



- **Tier 1 (Zero-Cost Draft & Experiment Mode):**

  ```bash

  python tools/cinematic_studio_cli.py produce-film "Title" --genre "catastrophe" --duration 60 --plan-only

  ```

  *Cost: 0 Credits.* Grok 4.6 screenplay, Deepgram Aura-2 voiceover, Remotion graphics, and color storyboard proxy cards.



